  "description": "Automatically converts DateTime values to UTC when writing to PostgreSQL and ensures\n\t\t\tall DateTime values read back are marked as DateTimeKind.Utc.\n\t\t\tSupports raw Npgsql, Dapper, and EF Core.\n\t\t\tOptional TimeZoneId converts UTC reads to any IANA timezone (e.g. \"Asia/Manila\", \"America/Los_Angeles\").",
  "id": "ChronoSafe.Npgsql",
